@startuml
title List this machine's checkouts - code
package "src/server/workflow" {
  class "repository-names.mjs" as Names <<module>>
  class "machine-checkouts.mjs" as Checkouts <<new module>> {
    + recordCheckout()
  }
}
package "src/server/review" {
  class "review-app-discovery.mjs" as App <<module>>
}
package "src/server" {
  class "mcp.mjs" as Mcp <<module>>
}
Mcp --> Names : checks the host's project at start
Names --> Checkouts : records an accepted checkout
Checkouts --> App : finds Prism's application folder
@enduml
